    "text": "In the given circuit diagram the current through the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math> resistor is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi></math>. Find the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi></math>&nbsp;(in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>)?<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0022_c02160ad9975.png\" style=\"width: 370px; height: 240px;\" />"
  },
